## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-processor to redact PII in OTEL attributes
class RedactProcessor {
  process(span) {
    const redacted = ['cardNumber','email','ip'];
    redacted.forEach(k => {
      if (span.attributes[k]) span.attributes[k] = 'REDACTED';
    });
    return span;
  }
}
```

